    <name>LettersFall 110%</name>
    <summary>Educational American English word spelling game with falling letters</summary>

    <description>
    <p>
    When you combine the video game Tetris with the board game Scrabble you get LettersFall 110%! Letters rapidly fall and you must correctly spell American English words to clear them.
    </p>

    <p>
    LettersFall 110% is a free, open-source educational word puzzle arcade game for Linux. Features nice graphics, good sound effects, and a great music soundtrack. Also has easy to play mouse controls and fun and challenging gameplay.
    </p>

    <p>
    Plus multiple game modes with varying difficulty and a saved high score table for each mode. Features a 450,000+ word American English dictionary. Do you have the skills to battle your way to the end and win? "Learn To Have Fun!"
    </p>
    </description>

    <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.savantsavior.lettersfall.desktop</launchable>

